            <description><![CDATA[<h2>RestinPID 3.8</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Asks before it restarts or quits an app.</b> Unsaved work in that app is lost, so this is now on by default. Turn it off in Settings → General.</li>
<li><b>Safer force quit:</b> RestinPID checks it is still the same app before quitting it, including after you type an admin password.</li>
<li>If a restart or force quit fails, you now see a message saying so and what to try.</li>
<li>Restart tries again if the app doesn't open the first time.</li>
<li>Installer, Disk Utility and Migration Assistant are never restarted automatically.</li>
<li>Uses less energy: the glow and jiggle stop after 10 minutes. The red icon stays until you open the panel.</li>
<li>The app now includes its licence (MIT) and Sparkle's.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
